ame": "Zhang, L."}, {"full_name": "Zhang, W."}, {"full_name": "Zucchelli, S."}], "texkeys": ["CDF:1997gvd", "Abe:1997jp"], "collaborations": [{"value": "CDF"}], "abstracts": [{"value": "We report the first observation of diffractively produced W bosons. In a sample of W -> e nu events produced in p-barp collisions at sqrt{s}=1.8 TeV, we find an excess of events with a forward rapidity gap, which is attributed to diffraction. The probability that this excess is consistent with non-diffractive production is 1.1 10^{-4} (3.8 sigma). The relatively low fraction of W+Jet events observed within this excess implies that mainly quarks from the pomeron, which mediates diffraction, participate in W production. The diffractive to non-diffractive W production ratio is found to be R_W=(1.15 +/- 0.55)%."}], "titles": [{"title": "Observation of diffractive $W$ boson production at the Tevatron"}, {"title": "Observation of diffractive W boson production at the Tevatron"}, {"title": "Observation of Diffractive W Boson Production at the Tevatron"}], "author_count": 460, "control_number": 440095, "dois": [{"value": "10.1103/PhysRevLett.78.2698"}], "arxiv_eprints": [{"value": "hep-ex/9703010"}], "document_type": ["article"]}, "created": "1997-02-04T00:00:00+00:00", "links": {"bibtex": "https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/440095?format=bibtex", "latex-eu": "https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/440095?format=latex-eu", "latex-us": "https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/440095?format=latex-us", "json": "https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/440095?format=json", "json-expanded": "https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/440095?format=json-expanded", "cv": "https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/440095?format=cv", "citations": "https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/?q=refersto%3Arecid%3A440095"}, "id": "440095"}], "total": 1}, "links": {"self": "https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/?sort=mostcited&q=j%20Phys.Rev.Lett.%2C78%2C2698&size=3&page=1&fields=control_number,titles.title,authors.full_